## Recommended Refactoring Plan

### Phase 1 — Security Fire Drill (Do today)

1. **Add [.env](file:///c:/Users/Varun/Mits/backend/.env) to [.gitignore](file:///c:/Users/Varun/Mits/backend/.gitignore)** and check `git log --all -- .env` — if it was ever committed, run `git filter-repo` to purge it and rotate the Google OAuth client ID immediately.
2. **Fix the `generalOffice` privilege escalation**: Move `assignRole` and `removeRoleAssignment` to [admin.routes.js](file:///c:/Users/Varun/Mits/backend/Routes/Admin/admin.routes.js) and restrict to `administrator` role only.
3. **Add URL validation** in `uploadDocument` and `submitPayment` — whitelist allowed domains (your CDN/cloud storage bucket):
   ```js
   function isAllowedUrl(url) {
     try { const u = new URL(url); return u.hostname.endsWith("yourstoragecdn.com"); }
     catch { return false; }
   }
   ```
