### Phase 3 — Architecture (Next two weeks)

13. **Add Express security middleware**: `helmet`, `express-rate-limit` (especially on `/api/auth/google`), `express-mongo-sanitize`.
14. **Issue signed JWTs on login** instead of re-verifying with Google on every request. Store `role` and `googleSub` in the JWT payload.
